# Build context of ops/docker/node.Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Nothing secret or bulky may reach the image layers (PLAN §9.4, §11.1).

# VCS and editor state
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode

# Dependencies and build outputs (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.astro
**/.turbo
**/.vite
**/.cache
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Environment files: never in an image (production values live in Coolify)
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Dumps, backups and key material
**/*.dump
**/*.dmp
**/*.sql.gz
**/*.backup
**/*.pem
**/*.key
tooling/migration/out
tooling/migration/rehearsal/out

# Test artefacts and unrelated trees
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/blob-report
**/.lighthouseci
e2e
docs
ops
!ops/docker/runtime-deps.mjs
!ops/docker/node-entrypoint.sh
!ops/docker/tools-entrypoint.sh
**/*.log
